Make the smallest panel-routing change.

- Keep `CURSOR_DEFAULT_MODEL = "composer-2.5"` unchanged.
- Keep `CURSOR_AUTO_MODEL = "auto"` as the single literal for reviewer overrides.
- Add `cursor_model=CURSOR_AUTO_MODEL` to Cursor reviewer `SlotDefault`s only:
  - `review.panel`: `correctness`, `edge-cases`, `testing`.
  - `design.plan_review_panel`: `arch`, `innovation`, `pragmatic`, `requirements`.
- Remove the always-on `plan-fidelity-auto` slot from `review.panel`.
- Remove the special `is_additive_plan_fidelity` branch in code-review static dispatch.
- Keep `_append_forced_plan_fidelity_row` and `PLAN_FIDELITY_FORCED`.
- Repoint the Codex fallback model-role lookup in `_append_forced_plan_fidelity_row` from deleted archetype `plan-fidelity-auto` to surviving archetype `testing`, so it still resolves to `"review"` on all tiers.
- Thread `cursor_model` and matching `resolved_model` into all Cursor reviewer manifest rows that launch on `auto`:
  - Code-review static Cursor rows.
  - Code-review dynamic Cursor rows.
  - Plan-review static Cursor rows.
  - Plan-review dynamic Cursor rows.
- Preserve `model_role` behavior for Codex rows.
- Preserve `--no-fallback` behavior and slot names for surviving rows.
- Map forced plan-fidelity tally output to `architecture`, not the `code-quality` default for unknown static slugs.

